-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material

* The example images in examples/ are synthetic warps of PubLayNet pages, and
  the weights were trained on such warps. PubLayNet (Zhong et al., ICDAR 2019)
  is distributed under the Community Data License Agreement - Permissive,
  Version 1.0 (https://cdla.io/permissive-1-0/).
* The DocUNet benchmark images and its MATLAB evaluation code (including
  Ce Liu's SIFT-flow) are NOT included; evaluation/docunet/ patches the official
  code locally after you download it. They remain under their authors' terms.
  The only exception is the paper figure paper/figs/docunet_qual.* (also in
  paper/main.pdf), which shows small thumbnails of a few benchmark photos and
  scans for scholarly illustration.
